---
description: OpenAPI-first DDD codegen — core-only after YAML edits; full scaffold for new domains
globs:
  - packages/openapi-core/**/*
  - packages/core/**/*
  - platform/**/*
  - .codegen/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

# DDD codegen (this repo)

- **New domain:** full multi-layer generate once, then hand-fit platform.
- **Existing domain YAML edit:** bundle → regenerate **`packages/core` only** → handwrite services/adapters/api-server.
- Package scope: `@aliaskeep/*`. Config: `.codegen/.zero-codegen-merged.json` (run `pnpm codegen:paths`).
- Skills: `ddd-platform`, `ddd-codegen`, `ddd-identity` under `.cursor/skills/`.
- Do not regenerate adapters/services casually — sandbox + nested DI are hand-maintained after scaffold.
